password field is unchanged or mismatched, nor which form context applies.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"KP-015\",\n      \"type\": \"inconsistency\",\n      \"subtype\": \"duplicate\",\n      \"evidence\": \"When the password field is changed the repeat password field must be Changed and be identical with password field\",\n      \"related_ids\": [\n        \"KP-012\",\n        \"KP-013\"\n      ],\n      \"rationale\": \"Overlaps with and restates the repeat-password completion requirement (KP-012) and equality requirement (KP-013), substituting 'changed' for 'completed' without clarifying distinct contexts.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"KP-016\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_error_handling\",\n      \"evidence\": \"An entry must be selected before it is duplicated\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Does not specify how the system behaves if duplication is invoked when no entry is selected.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"KP-017\",\n      \"type\": \"ambiguity\",\n      \"subtype\": \"referential\",\n      \"evidence\": \"For the following features, use cases are not included\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"'the following features' has no clear referent within the requirement (leaving unclear whether it refers to KP-018 through KP-032), and 'a browser' does not specify supported browsers.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"KP-017\",\n      \"type\": \"incompleteness\",\n      \"subtype\": \"missing_error_handling\",\n      \"evidence\": \"An internet connection and a browser are required in order to download new language translations\",\n      \"related_ids\": [],\n      \"rationale\": \"Does not specify what happens if no internet connection or browser is available, nor how downloaded translations are installed or activated.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"req_id\": \"KP-018\",\n      \"type\": \"ambiguity\",\n      \"subtype\": \"referential\",\n      \"evidence\"